---
/**
 * TF Unions Official Docs & Wiki (`https://docs.tfunions.com` / `https://tf-docs-portal.pages.dev`)
 */
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="dark scroll-smooth">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Official Documentation & Wiki | TF Unions</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Exo+2:wght@600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-[#070E24] text-white font-['Inter',sans-serif] flex flex-col">
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-30 backdrop-blur bg-[#070E24]/90 border-b border-white/10 px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a href="https://tf-foundation-portal.pages.dev" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#002583] border border-[#FFB800]/50 flex items-center justify-center font-['Exo_2'] font-extrabold text-[#FFB800]">TF</a>
        <div>
          <span class="font-['Exo_2'] font-bold text-base">TF Unions Docs &amp; Wiki</span>
          <span class="block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFB800]">Official Ecosystem Documentation</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs">
        <a href="https://tf-foundation-portal.pages.dev" class="text-slate-300 hover:text-white">Foundation Portal</a>
        <a href="https://tf-verify-portal.pages.dev" class="text-slate-300 hover:text-white">Verify Certificate</a>
        <a href="https://tf-auth-hub.pages.dev" class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg bg-[#FFB800] text-[#070E24] font-bold">Unified Sign In →</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full flex-1 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 px-6 py-10">
      <aside class="md:col-span-1 space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-[#0C1636] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-5 sticky top-24">
          <h3 class="font-['Exo_2'] font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#FFB800] mb-3">Documentation Sections</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li><a href="#overview" class="hover:text-[#FFB800] block">1. Ecosystem Overview</a></li>
            <li><a href="#platforms" class="hover:text-[#FFB800] block">2. Core Platforms &amp; Domains</a></li>
            <li><a href="#sso-guide" class="hover:text-[#FFB800] block">3. Unified SSO Passport Guide</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faq" class="hover:text-[#FFB800] block">4. Official 7-Point FAQ</a></li>
            <li><a href="#architecture" class="hover:text-[#FFB800] block">5. Self-Hosted VPS Stack</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <main class="md:col-span-3 space-y-12">
        <section id="overview" class="bg-[#0C1636] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-[#FFB800]/15 text-[#FFB800]">Official Handbook</span>
          <h1 class="font-['Exo_2'] font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl mt-3">Welcome to TF Unions Documentation</h1>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            <strong>TF Unions</strong> (formerly <em>Altafawwoq Union</em>) is an independent non-profit educational ecosystem founded by <strong>Mohammed Farag</strong> and <strong>Mohammed Abdelghany</strong>. We build open-access platforms, roadmaps, and communities that empower standout students across all 27 Egyptian governorates.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="platforms" class="bg-[#0C1636] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="font-['Exo_2'] font-bold text-2xl text-[#FFB800]">Core Ecosystem Platforms</h2>
          <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left text-xs border-collapse">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-white/15 text-slate-300">
                  <th class="py-3 pr-4">Platform</th>
                  <th class="py-3 pr-4">Live URL</th>
                  <th class="py-3">Purpose</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/10 text-slate-300">
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-bold text-white">Foundation Portal</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-[#FFB800]"><a href="https://tf-foundation-portal.pages.dev">tfunions.com</a></td>
                  <td class="py-3">Public mission, Volunteer HR portal, Idea Incubator, and 100% Open-Book Financial Ledger</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-bold text-white">Unified SSO Hub</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-[#FFB800]"><a href="https://tf-auth-hub.pages.dev">auth.tfunions.com</a></td>
                  <td class="py-3">Self-hosted VPS Single Sign-On passport across all TF Unions services</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-bold text-white">TF News</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-[#FFB800]"><a href="https://news.tfunions.com">news.tfunions.com</a></td>
                  <td class="py-3">Scholarships, olympiads, internships, and 1,500+ global university admission pathways</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-bold text-white">Certificate Verifier</td>
                  <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-[#FFB800]"><a href="https://tf-verify-portal.pages.dev">verify.tfunions.com</a></td>
                  <td class="py-3">Instant verification of TF Unions volunteer &amp; program certificates</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="sso-guide" class="bg-[#0C1636] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="font-['Exo_2'] font-bold text-2xl text-[#FFB800]">Unified SSO &amp; Account Guide</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <strong>One account. All TF Unions services.</strong> When you sign in at our Unified SSO Hub, the TF Unions VPS Identity Engine (<code class="text-[#FFB800]">tf_sso_api</code> backed by PostgreSQL <code class="text-[#FFB800]">tf_sso_db</code> and Baserow <code class="text-[#FFB800]">Members_Passport</code>) issues a root-domain session cookie scoped to <code class="text-[#FFB800]">.tfunions.com</code> so you stay authenticated across every subdomain.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="faq" class="bg-[#0C1636] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 space-y-5">
          <h2 class="font-['Exo_2'] font-bold text-2xl text-[#FFB800]">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">1. What is TF Unions?</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1">TF Unions is an independent non-profit initiative dedicated to helping ambitious students achieve their science-related goals through tools, roadmaps, and communities.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">2. Do I need to be a STEM school student to benefit from TF Unions?</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1"><strong>No.</strong> TF Unions is open to any student across Thanaweya Amma, STEM schools, IGCSE, American Diploma, Azhar, Prep schools, and Universities.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">3. Do I need top grades to be part of TF Unions?</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1"><strong>No.</strong> Being a standout student means having meaningful goals, taking initiative, staying curious, and working to improve yourself.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">4. Who funds TF Unions?</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1">TF Unions operates on a strict <strong>$0/month SaaS overhead</strong> architecture on our self-hosted VPS, with 100% open-book financial transparency.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
